  "notes_for_editor": "The gone status rests on the FFLA list; the Forest Service list and both lookout sites say only abandoned. Idaho Fire Lookouts states it has no documented staffing history, so no staff entry is made. No source states an access level; the hike-in tag is the only visit fact. The Forest Service list and the Idaho County listing agree on the location (T29N R8E Sect 25). No source describes the site today."
